+\subsection*{Value theorems: the C.2 first-order expansions}
+
+\begin{theorem}[Neighboring-ray slope to first order]
+\label{thm:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_2_C_2:ray_B_slope_first_order}
